“That girl won’t so much as nod her head if you don’t, isn’t that right?”
Meckart asked in a low voice. Ferris’s cat ears immediately detected a

change in the air. The flaxen animal ears he had inherited from his demi-
human ancestors were exceptionally sensitive to subtle shifts in the

atmosphere and environment.
“I know about the promise between you and Crusch,” Meckart went on.
