the corpse’s eyes drifted open.
“H—Hannah! Oh! Hannah!” Bean was ecstatic as the body shifted, sat
itself up. He nearly shoved Ferris out of the way as he took up a place at the

bedside. Ferris watched as his parents shared a reunion, even though one of
them had been dead only moments before.
