Surely Bean had known that. He was perfectly aware of the problem with
the spell itself; that was why he hadn’t brought his wife back on his own.
Why had he wanted Ferris to do it? Had he really hoped for something more?
Or did he just want to pass off responsibility for what would come of it?
Now, Ferris would never know.
