stairs, and Ferris immediately understood where Crusch had been held. She
had been shut up in that hideous basement room.
“That place again...!”
“Indeed. The master was rather set in his ways.”
Ferris burned with anger, but the maid, for her part, continued to smile,
still as lonesome as before. The expression didn’t leave her face as she
slowly approached the bed and the two corpses.
